{%- comment -%}
  Footer nou (referință client: panou închis cu marginea de sus curbată).
  1. Newsletter cu packshot-uri reale din catalog „împrăștiate" pe marginea de jos
     a panoului (src/_data/footerShots.js — doar PNG-uri cu fundal transparent).
  2. Rând de contact / magazine / program, cu separatoare verticale.
  3. Coloane de link-uri + metode de plată.
  4. Obligații legale RO (design-brief.md §1.3): denumire, CUI, Reg. Com., sediu,
     pictogramă SAL — FĂRĂ SOL (platforma e închisă din 20 iulie 2025).
  5. Bară de copyright.
  Fără rețele sociale: nu avem link-uri reale de la client — nu le inventăm.
{%- endcomment -%}
<footer class="footer">
  <div class="footer__panel">

    {%- comment -%} 1. Newsletter {%- endcomment -%}
    <section class="fnl" aria-labelledby="fnl-title">
      <div class="container fnl__inner">
        <p class="fnl__eyebrow">Newsletter</p>
        <h2 class="fnl__title" id="fnl-title">Abonează-te la ofertele Smartino</h2>
        <p class="fnl__lead">
          Reduceri, pachete promo și produse noi, direct pe email.
          Fără spam — te dezabonezi cu un click.
        </p>
        <form class="fnl__form" onsubmit="return false;">
          <label class="visually-hidden" for="fnl-email">Adresa ta de email</label>
          <input class="fnl__input" id="fnl-email" type="email" name="email"
                 placeholder="adresa@email.ro" autocomplete="email" required>
          <button class="btn btn--primary fnl__btn" type="submit">Abonează-mă</button>
        </form>
        <p class="fnl__terms">
          Prin abonare ești de acord cu
          <a href="{{ '/pages/politica-de-confidentialitate/' | url }}">politica de confidențialitate</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="fnl__shots" aria-hidden="true">
        {%- for s in footerShots -%}
          {%- assign p = catalog.productsByHandle[s.handle] -%}
          {%- if p and p.image -%}
            <img class="fnl__shot{% if s.mobile %} fnl__shot--m{% endif %}"
                 style="--x:{{ s.x }};--w:{{ s.w }}px;--r:{{ s.r }}deg;--b:{{ s.b }}px"
                 src="{{ p.image.src | cdn: 300 }}"
                 srcset="{{ p.image.src | srcset: 200,300,400,600 }}"
                 sizes="{{ s.w }}px" alt="" width="{{ p.image.width }}" height="{{ p.image.height }}"
                 loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container">

      {%- comment -%} 2. Contact / magazine / program {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="finfo">
        <div class="finfo__cell">
          <p class="finfo__label">
            {%- assign icon = "phone" -%}<svg class="fico" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">{% include "components/icons.liquid" %}</svg>
            Comenzi &amp; suport
          </p>
          <a class="finfo__big" href="tel:+40374072222">0374 072 222</a>
          <a class="finfo__line" href="mailto:info@smartinoshop.ro">info@smartinoshop.ro</a>
          <p class="finfo__line finfo__muted">Luni–Vineri 09:00–17:00</p>
        </div>
        <div class="finfo__cell">
          <p class="finfo__label">
            {%- assign icon = "pin" -%}<svg class="fico" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">{% include "components/icons.liquid" %}</svg>
            Smartino Supermarket
          </p>
          <p class="finfo__line">DN1, Snagov · jud. Ilfov</p>
          <p class="finfo__line finfo__muted">L–V 07:00–22:00 · S–D 08:00–21:00</p>
          <a class="finfo__line" href="tel:+40755210178">0755 210 178</a>
        </div>
        <div class="finfo__cell">
          <p class="finfo__label">
            {%- assign icon = "pin" -%}<svg class="fico" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">{% include "components/icons.liquid" %}</svg>
            Smartino Home
          </p>
          <p class="finfo__line">Intersecția Snagov, Șos. București-Ploiești DN1</p>
          <p class="finfo__line finfo__muted">Luni–Duminică 10:00–21:00</p>
          <a class="finfo__line" href="tel:+40755210121">0755 210 121</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} 3. Coloane {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="fcols">
        <div class="fcols__brand">
          <a class="wordmark wordmark--footer" href="{{ '/' | url }}" aria-label="Smartino — acasă">smartino<sup>®</sup></a>
          <p class="fcols__about">
            Importator oficial Sleepy în România. Scutece pentru copii și adulți,
            șervețele umede, produse de curățenie și cosmetice coreene originale —
            online și în magazinele din Snagov.
          </p>
          <ul class="fcols__usp">
            <li>{%- assign icon = "truck" -%}<svg class="fico" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">{% include "components/icons.liquid" %}</svg> Livrare gratuită peste {{ shop.freeShipping }} lei</li>
            <li>{%- assign icon = "return" -%}<svg class="fico" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">{% include "components/icons.liquid" %}</svg> Retur în {{ shop.returnDays }} zile</li>
            <li>{%- assign icon = "shield" -%}<svg class="fico" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">{% include "components/icons.liquid" %}</svg> Plată securizată 3D Secure</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <nav class="fcols__col" aria-labelledby="fcol-cat">
          <p class="fcols__h" id="fcol-cat">Categorii</p>
          <ul>
            {%- for c in nav.primary limit: 8 -%}
              <li><a href="{{ c.url | url }}">{{ c.title }}</a></li>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </ul>
        </nav>

        <nav class="fcols__col" aria-labelledby="fcol-help">
          <p class="fcols__h" id="fcol-help">Ajutor</p>
          <ul>
            {%- for l in nav.footer.ajutor -%}<li><a href="{{ l.url | url }}">{{ l.title }}</a></li>{%- endfor -%}
          </ul>
        </nav>

        <nav class="fcols__col" aria-labelledby="fcol-about">
          <p class="fcols__h" id="fcol-about">Smartino</p>
          <ul>
            {%- for l in nav.footer.despre -%}<li><a href="{{ l.url | url }}">{{ l.title }}</a></li>{%- endfor -%}
            {%- for l in nav.footer.legal -%}<li><a href="{{ l.url | url }}">{{ l.title }}</a></li>{%- endfor -%}
          </ul>
        </nav>

        <div class="fcols__col fcols__pay">
          <p class="fcols__h">Plăți acceptate</p>
          <ul class="paycards" role="list">
            <li class="paycard" role="listitem" title="Visa">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 48 16" aria-hidden="true"><text x="24" y="13" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="15" font-weight="700" font-style="italic" fill="#1A1F71">VISA</text></svg>
              <span class="visually-hidden">Visa</span>
            </li>
            <li class="paycard" role="listitem" title="Mastercard">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 48 30" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="18" cy="15" r="9.5" fill="#EB001B"/><circle cx="30" cy="15" r="9.5" fill="#F79E1B" fill-opacity=".92"/></svg>
              <span class="visually-hidden">Mastercard</span>
            </li>
            <li class="paycard" role="listitem" title="Maestro">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 48 30" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="18" cy="15" r="9.5" fill="#0099DF"/><circle cx="30" cy="15" r="9.5" fill="#ED0006" fill-opacity=".92"/></svg>
              <span class="visually-hidden">Maestro</span>
            </li>
            <li class="paycard paycard--text" role="listitem">Ramburs</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="fcols__paynote">Plăți online securizate prin PayU și MobilPay.</p>
          {%- comment -%}
            Pictogramă SAL, 250×50 px, conform Ordinului ANPC 449/2022.
            SOL a fost eliminat prin OPANPC 270/2026 — nu se mai afișează.
            Placeholder până primim assetul oficial de la client.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          <a class="anpc-badge" href="https://anpc.ro/ce-este-sal/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">
            <span class="anpc-badge__mark">ANPC</span>
            <span class="anpc-badge__text">Soluționarea Alternativă<br>a Litigiilor</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} 4 + 5. Legal + copyright {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="fbottom">
      <div class="container fbottom__inner">
        <p class="fbottom__legal">
          S.C. SMARTINO INTERNATIONAL S.R.L. · CUI RO37843488 · J2017003263233 ·
          Str. Avram Iancu nr. 22–26F, Otopeni, jud. Ilfov
        </p>
        <p class="fbottom__copy">© {{ "now" | date: "%Y" }} Smartino. Toate drepturile rezervate.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
